Nexus Godot Pipeline — licensing overview
===================================

The Nexus Godot pipeline consists of two addons with different licenses:

| Addon            | Runtime | License              |
|------------------|---------|----------------------|
| nexus_importer   | Godot   | MIT                  |
| nexus_b2g        | Blender | GPL-3.0-or-later     |

This repository directory is the Godot importer only.
The Blender exporter is separate software. Its full GPL-3.0
license text is in `nexus_b2g/LICENSE`.

Using both addons together does not change either license. Distribute and comply
with each addon under its own terms.


